@startuml reporting-use-case
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title REPORTING SERVICE - USE CASE

actor "Brand/Platform viewer" as Viewer
actor "Order Service" as Order
actor "Internal operator" as Internal
actor "Machine Service" as Machine
actor "Operation Service" as Operation

rectangle "Reporting Service" {
  usecase "Tìm kiếm giao dịch" as Search
  usecase "Xem transaction/revenue/refund summary" as Summary
  usecase "Xem dashboard" as Dashboard
  usecase "Xuất transactions Excel" as ExportTx
  usecase "Xuất revenue Excel" as ExportRevenue
  usecase "Sync transaction" as Sync
  usecase "Sync payment từ Order" as Pull
  usecase "Lấy machine/alert snapshot" as MachineSnapshot
  usecase "Lấy inventory/maintenance snapshot" as OperationSnapshot
}

Viewer --> Search
Viewer --> Summary
Viewer --> Dashboard
Viewer --> ExportTx
Viewer --> ExportRevenue
Order --> Sync
Internal --> Pull
Machine --> MachineSnapshot
Operation --> OperationSnapshot

note bottom of Dashboard
  Dashboard tổng hợp local transactions và snapshot upstream.
  Upstream lỗi được phản ánh trong phần trạng thái, không sở hữu dữ liệu chéo.
end note

@enduml
